{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Chernobog Outfit represents Slavic mythology in a modern interpretation. His equipment shows a connection with a raven: the feather-like blades are conveniently located for quick use, a shroud that reminds of folded wings and doesn\u2019t restrain movement, and the boots with treads that imitate the bird\u2019s claws. On the operator\u2019s chest, there is a medallion with Chernobog\u2019s symbol which represents his constant connection with darkness. Armed to the teeth, he brings his AK-12 prototype to the battlefield: an improved model of the famous assault rifle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This kit contains:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CHERNOBOG MYTHIC OUTFIT FOR VORON</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The outfit changes not only the operator and his weapon\u2019s appearance, but also reloading animations, tracers\u2019 color (for AK-12 without a suppressor), cases\u2019 color as well as ability and barrel heating visual effects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Also, you'll receive +30% XP for playing Voron regardless of whether the outfit is equipped or not. The additional XP can be added to the bonuses of Legendary Outfits, so the maximum bonus reaches +50%.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If this item is already on your account, you will receive compensation \u2014 7 200 Fragments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Reloading animations:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440193/extras/RELOADING-ANIMATION.gif?t=1746016951\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ability visual effects:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440193/extras/ABILITY-VISUAL-EFFECTS_2.gif?t=1746016951\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DEATHBRINGER EXECUTION FOR VORON</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440193/extras/DEATHBRINGER-EXECUTION-FOR-VORON.gif?t=1746016951\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CHERNOBOG\u2019S GIFT REPRISAL FOR VORON</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440193/extras/Backstab.gif?t=1746016951\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">HERALD EMOTE FOR VORON</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440193/extras/HERALD-EMOTE-FOR-VORON.gif?t=1746016951\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">HUNTING GROUNDS HQ BACKGROUND</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440193/extras/hq_lEYp0I3.jpg?t=1746016951\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CHERNOBOG EMBLEM</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440193/extras/CHERNOBOG-EMBLEM_2.gif?t=1746016951\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GRIM FOREST CAMO FOR VORON</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440193/extras/camo_kpmDLnJ.jpg?t=1746016951\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ASSAULT VORON FROM THE SSO COLLECTION</p></li></